@id: scene.mechanical_lore
@when: Unknown.scene_mechanical_lore
@where: Realm/Physical/Unknown
@scope: narrative

=segments:
  - line: 1
    type: narration
    text: "Technical Lore Bible and Gameplay Systems Analysis: The Fifth Coming"
  - line: 3
    type: narration
    text: "1."
  - line: 4
    type: narration
    text: "Executive Summary of World State & Core Lore"
  - line: 6
    type: narration
    text: "The operational theater is currently undergoing a catastrophic phase shift from the \"White Phase\"—a three-thousand-year era of Anunnaki atmospheric stability—to the \"Red Darkness\" triggered by the manifestation of Nibiru."
  - line: 7
    type: narration
    text: "This transition represents a systemic failure of the ancient \"Cradle\" infrastructure."
  - line: 8
    type: narration
    text: "The arrival of Nibiru serves as the primary catalyst for the awakening of dormant bloodline abilities in the terrestrial population."
  - line: 9
    type: narration
    text: "The shattering of the artificial 47-minute lightning cycle, which previously regulated biological and magical rhythms, has forced the planet into a state of ecological shock and unmoored time."
  - line: 11
    type: narration
    text: "The Five Phases of Nibiru"
  - line: 13
    type: narration
    text: "Atmospheric collapse follows a specific color-coded progression as the Earth's failing atmospheric lattice fractures."
  - line: 15
    type: narration
    text: "Phase	Environmental Effects	Gameplay Impact (\"So What?\")"
  - line: 16
    type: narration
    text: "White	Sterile light; 47-minute scheduled lightning strikes."
  - line: 17
    type: narration
    text: "High predictability; magical abilities are suppressed by the Star Needle."
  - line: 18
    type: narration
    text: "Yellow	Amber gloom; -8°C temperature drop; geometric clouds fracture."
  - line: 19
    type: narration
    text: "Resource stress; crops wither; first awakening of bloodline heat/auras."
  - line: 20
    type: narration
    text: "Purple	Deep violet bruising; chaotic lightning; toxic fungal blooms."
  - line: 21
    type: narration
    text: "Atmospheric toxicity; high mutation risk; biological environmental debuffs."
  - line: 22
    type: narration
    text: "Crimson	Blood-red sky; gravitational air theft; metabolic strain."
  - line: 23
    type: narration
    text: "Oxygen depletion; surge in \"Crimson Blood\" damage and efficacy."
  - line: 24
    type: narration
    text: "Black	Total solar eclipse; absolute absence of possibility."
  - line: 25
    type: narration
    text: "End-game survival; internal \"Solar\" or \"Void\" light sources are mandatory."
  - line: 27
    type: narration
    text: "Baseline Environmental Shift: The Cradle Clock Failure"
  - line: 29
    type: narration
    text: "* The 09:08 Event: The definitive end of the \"White Phase\" occurred at 09:08, following a final successful strike at 08:21."
  - line: 30
    type: narration
    text: "This failure serves as the \"Global Server Event\" marker for atmospheric collapse."
  - line: 31
    type: narration
    text: "* Temperature & Ice-Fall: A baseline drop to -12°C triggers \"ice-fall\"—a specific particle effect where crystallized breath falls like snow, indicating immediate metabolic risk."
  - line: 32
    type: narration
    text: "* Geometric Infrastructure: Weather is diagnostic."
  - line: 33
    type: narration
    text: "\"Geometric Cloud\" patterns and water channels act as calibration grids."
  - line: 34
    type: narration
    text: "Movement within these grids is required for power stabilization."
  - line: 37
    type: scene_header
    text: "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
  - line: 40
    type: narration
    text: "2."
  - line: 41
    type: narration
    text: "Theoretical Framework of Power Systems"
  - line: 43
    type: narration
    text: "To counter Ironspire’s technological suppression, players must awaken bloodline systems—physiological interfaces that interact with Solar Mathematics and dimensional frequencies."
  - line: 45
    type: narration
    text: "Primary Power Systems"
  - line: 47
    type: narration
    text: "Phoenix Fire (Solar/Enhancement)"
  - line: 49
    type: narration
    text: "* Description: Channeling stellar core energies."
  - line: 50
    type: narration
    text: "Players transition from the terrestrial farmer identity (Tran) to the awakened Phoenix Host (Thang)."
  - line: 51
    type: narration
    text: "* Gameplay Function: High-damage output and \"Solar Mathematics\" (calculating projectile trajectories through internal heat)."
  - line: 52
    type: narration
    text: "* Tactical Cost: Extreme internal temperature spikes; requires aura suppression to avoid thermal detection by Ironspire scanners."
  - line: 54
    type: narration
    text: "Shadow Magic (Void/Ethereal)"
  - line: 56
    type: narration
    text: "* Description: Phasing between solid matter and living darkness."
  - line: 57
    type: narration
    text: "* Gameplay Function: Stealth, dimensional phasing, and \"Shadow-walking.\""
  - line: 58
    type: narration
    text: "* Tactical Cost: Tissue Necrosis."
  - line: 59
    type: narration
    text: "Extended use causes black veins to creep up the limbs like frost patterns, reducing max HP until stabilized."
  - line: 61
    type: narration
    text: "Adrenochrome (Temporal/Chaos)"
  - line: 63
    type: narration
    text: "* Description: \"Liquid possibility\" derived from Draco essence."
  - line: 64
    type: narration
    text: "* Gameplay Function: Temporal manipulation and rapid cellular regeneration."
  - line: 65
    type: narration
    text: "* Tactical Cost: Temporal Vertigo."
  - line: 66
    type: narration
    text: "Excessive use causes localized aging (e.g., a character’s hand aging to leathery parchment) and permanent genetic memory loss."
  - line: 68
    type: narration
    text: "The First Tongue (Linguistic/Creation)"
  - line: 70
    type: narration
    text: "* Description: Primordial commands that rewrite physical laws."
  - line: 71
    type: narration
    text: "* Sample Command: \"Sek’han vel thara nix\" (Ignite/Summon Light)."
  - line: 72
    type: narration
    text: "* Tactical Cost: Requires physiological larynx modification."
  - line: 73
    type: narration
    text: "Usage causes internal hemorrhaging and \"Larynx Tearing.\" Note: Must be paired with Adrenochrome to heal the resulting necrosis."
  - line: 76
    type: scene_header
    text: "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
  - line: 79
    type: narration
    text: "3."
  - line: 80
    type: narration
    text: "Advanced Combat Mechanics & Elemental Synergies"
  - line: 82
    type: narration
    text: "Synergistic combat is the only viable counter to the overwhelming \"Compliance Protocols\" of the Iron Guard and Anunnaki Sentinels."
  - line: 84
    type: narration
    text: "Synergy Patterns"
  - line: 86
    type: narration
    text: "* Balanced Null-Zones (Fire + Void): Shadow-walking cools the Phoenix aura, allowing for high-heat strikes while remaining invisible to thermal sensors."
  - line: 87
    type: narration
    text: "* The Restoration Loop (Adrenochrome + First Tongue): Adrenochrome’s rapid regeneration is the essential catalyst for First Tongue usage."
  - line: 88
    type: narration
    text: "It allows the speaker to heal the larynx tearing and hemorrhaging caused by high-frequency commands in real-time."
  - line: 89
    type: narration
    text: "* Crimson Redirection: Using Phoenix Fire to \"overcharge\" the vitality of allies while Shadow Magic shields mitigate the resulting heat damage."
  - line: 91
    type: narration
    text: "Archetype Analysis: The Scythe-Bearer"
  - line: 93
    type: narration
    text: "The Scythe-Bearer (Thang/Tran) utilizes the Crystalline Scythe as a focal point."
  - line: 95
    type: narration
    text: "* Geometric Efficiency: Damage and precision increase significantly when fighting within \"Geometric Cloud\" patterns or at \"Geometric Intersections.\" The scythe catches light in patterns that match the Star Needle’s inscriptions, allowing the wielder to anticipate enemy movement through \"cellular imprints.\""
  - line: 98
    type: scene_header
    text: "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
  - line: 101
    type: narration
    text: "4."
  - line: 102
    type: narration
    text: "Progression Pathways & Metaphysical Unlocks"
  - line: 104
    type: narration
    text: "Progression is gated by the \"Network,\" which evaluates a player's intent through the Record of Intent."
  - line: 106
    type: narration
    text: "The Record of Intent"
  - line: 108
    type: narration
    text: "To unlock the \"End-Game\" classes, players must sign their name in the eternal archives at a permanent cost."
  - line: 110
    type: narration
    text: "* The Price of Admission: To gain power, the player must sacrifice specific, high-pathos memories."
  - line: 111
    type: narration
    text: "This is not a generic stat reduction but a narrative loss (e.g., the memory of a first sunrise or a mother’s lullabies)."
  - line: 112
    type: narration
    text: "Once surrendered, these memories are replaced by \"Stellar Lifecycle Data.\""
  - line: 113
    type: narration
    text: "* End-Game Class Unlocks:"
  - line: 114
    type: narration
    text: "* Phoenix Host: Mastery of stellar processes and planetary reality."
  - line: 115
    type: narration
    text: "* Void Scribe: Mastery of the ethereal realms and the Record of Intent."
  - line: 118
    type: scene_header
    text: "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
  - line: 121
    type: narration
    text: "5."
  - line: 122
    type: narration
    text: "Encyclopedia of Artifacts and Equipment"
  - line: 124
    type: narration
    text: "Name	Description	Gameplay Utility"
  - line: 125
    type: narration
    text: "The Star Needle	300ft crystalline spire; shifting inscriptions."
  - line: 126
    type: narration
    text: "The Cradle Clock: Regulates the 47-minute lightning cycle and atmospheric stability."
  - line: 127
    type: narration
    text: "Heart of Lyraleth	Concentrated lunar essence."
  - line: 128
    type: narration
    text: "Instantaneous dimensional transport; consumes the total life force of the user (Sacrifice Mechanic)."
  - line: 129
    type: narration
    text: "Lyra’s Sphere	Sentient crystalline orb from Echo Temple."
  - line: 130
    type: narration
    text: "Resonates with First Tongue users; functions as a \"Memory Key\" for the Network."
  - line: 131
    type: narration
    text: "The Tome	Ancient text of the First Tongue."
  - line: 132
    type: narration
    text: "Unlocks linguistic commands; updates its inscriptions in real-time based on player awakening."
  - line: 133
    type: narration
    text: "Crystalline Scythe	Solar-forged blade fused with lunar crystal."
  - line: 134
    type: narration
    text: "EXPANDED: Evolution of the agricultural scythe; focuses Phoenix Fire and grants \"Scythe-Bearer\" bonuses."
  - line: 137
    type: scene_header
    text: "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
  - line: 140
    type: narration
    text: "6."
  - line: 141
    type: narration
    text: "Faction Analysis: Goals, Methods, and Ideologies"
  - line: 143
    type: narration
    text: "Faction Name	Strategic Goal	Primary Method"
  - line: 144
    type: narration
    text: "Ironspire (Iron Guard)	Technological Hegemony	Systematic \"Magical Registries,\" medical experimentation, and electromagnetic surveillance."
  - line: 145
    type: narration
    text: "The Moon Kingdom	Cosmic Stewardship	Preservation of \"Cradle\" systems and protection of the \"Prophesied Heir.\""
  - line: 146
    type: narration
    text: "Ethereal Scholars	Curation of Universal Knowledge	Mind-erasure of rivals; hoarding of dimensional maps; \"Curation as Control.\""
  - line: 147
    type: narration
    text: "The Anunnaki	Biological Control	Sentinel orbs, \"Compliance Protocols,\" and genetic harvesting of bloodlines."
  - line: 150
    type: scene_header
    text: "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
  - line: 153
    type: narration
    text: "7."
  - line: 154
    type: narration
    text: "Locations and Biome Rules"
  - line: 156
    type: narration
    text: "* Sundrift Valley: A post-collapse wasteland."
  - line: 157
    type: narration
    text: "Players must navigate the \"Geometric Water Channels\" to avoid the -12°C baseline cold."
  - line: 158
    type: narration
    text: "VFX Note: Ambient \"ice-fall\" particles indicate areas of high metabolic drain."
  - line: 159
    type: narration
    text: "* The Northern Eye: A dimensional anchor point."
  - line: 160
    type: narration
    text: "Perspective bends at impossible angles."
  - line: 161
    type: narration
    text: "Serves as a Fast-Travel hub to the \"Heart of the Network.\""
  - line: 162
    type: narration
    text: "* Asteroid Communication Array: A debris field the size of a solar system."
  - line: 163
    type: narration
    text: "Requires low-gravity combat proficiency and vacuum survival gear."
  - line: 166
    type: scene_header
    text: "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
  - line: 169
    type: narration
    text: "8."
  - line: 170
    type: narration
    text: "Bestiary: Bosses and Enemy Types"
  - line: 172
    type: narration
    text: "* The Bone-Tide (Herald Kha’therak): 12-foot-tall entity."
  - line: 173
    type: narration
    text: "Boss Mechanic: Emits a 47 Hz vibration that causes weapon resonance."
  - line: 174
    type: narration
    text: "This increases the failure rate of player attacks unless the player harmonizes their rhythm."
  - line: 175
    type: narration
    text: "* Asag (The Stone-Born): A tectonic guardian."
  - line: 176
    type: narration
    text: "Utilizes \"Black Oil\" attacks that corrode both stone and spirit."
  - line: 177
    type: narration
    text: "* Galla-Stones: Reactive stone guardians that respond specifically to \"Forbidden Bloodline\" energy signatures."
  - line: 180
    type: scene_header
    text: "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
  - line: 183
    type: narration
    text: "9."
  - line: 184
    type: narration
    text: "Resource Management & Economic Systems"
  - line: 186
    type: narration
    text: "* Life Force (Fuel): Consumed by high-tier artifacts."
  - line: 187
    type: narration
    text: "Depletion results in \"translucency\" and death."
  - line: 188
    type: narration
    text: "* Vril (Energy): The primary mana source."
  - line: 189
    type: narration
    text: "Harvested from \"Geometric Nodes.\""
  - line: 190
    type: narration
    text: "* Genetic Memories (Currency): Sacrificed to unlock high-tier skills."
  - line: 191
    type: narration
    text: "* Sensory Cues for Resources:"
  - line: 192
    type: narration
    text: "* Mineral Breath: Smells like wet quartz and damp clay, indicating a nearby resource node."
  - line: 193
    type: narration
    text: "* Subsonic Thrum: A 47 Hz vibration indicating active \"Cradle\" technology."
  - line: 196
    type: scene_header
    text: "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
  - line: 199
    type: narration
    text: "10."
  - line: 200
    type: narration
    text: "Systemic Rules, Limits, and Risks"
  - line: 202
    type: narration
    text: "Action	Risk	Reward"
  - line: 203
    type: narration
    text: "Shadow-walking	Tissue Necrosis: Black veins and progressive HP drain."
  - line: 204
    type: narration
    text: "Dimensional invisibility and phasing."
  - line: 205
    type: narration
    text: "Phoenix Aura	Thermal Detection: Increases visibility to Ironspire."
  - line: 206
    type: narration
    text: "Massive physical buffs and \"Purification\" damage."
  - line: 207
    type: narration
    text: "First Tongue Usage	Larynx Tearing: Causes internal hemorrhaging (Necrosis)."
  - line: 208
    type: narration
    text: "Direct command over physical laws (Fire, Light, Kinetic)."
  - line: 209
    type: narration
    text: "Cosmic Citizenship	Identity Erasure: Permanent loss of personal history."
  - line: 210
    type: narration
    text: "Access to the Ancient Network and End-Game Titles."
  - line: 213
    type: scene_header
    text: "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
  - line: 216
    type: narration
    text: "11."
  - line: 217
    type: narration
    text: "Analysis of Systemic Contradictions and Ambiguities"
  - line: 219
    type: narration
    text: "* The Star Needle Chronology: Source material remains inconsistent regarding its age—is it 20 years old (Ironspire era) or 3,000 years old (Anunnaki era)?"
  - line: 220
    type: narration
    text: "* The Mika Timeline: Clarification is required for \"The Five Mikas.\" Are these separate NPCs, or do they represent a \"Hive-Mind\" entity or a reincarnated sequence?"
  - line: 221
    type: narration
    text: "This affects player-NPC interaction logic."
  - line: 224
    type: scene_header
    text: "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
  - line: 227
    type: narration
    text: "12."
  - line: 228
    type: narration
    text: "Reusable Gameplay Patterns (Developer’s Cheat Sheet)"
  - line: 230
    type: scene_header
    text: "### CORE GAMEPLAY LOOPS"
  - line: 232
    type: narration
    text: "1."
  - line: 233
    type: narration
    text: "THE STEALTH LOOP:"
  - line: 234
    type: narration
    text: "- Mask thermal signatures using Shadow Magic."
  - line: 235
    type: narration
    text: "- Monitor Tissue Necrosis."
  - line: 236
    type: narration
    text: "- Stabilize at a \"Mineral Breath\" node (Quartz/Clay) to reset debuffs."
  - line: 238
    type: narration
    text: "2."
  - line: 239
    type: narration
    text: "THE RESTORATION LOOP:"
  - line: 240
    type: narration
    text: "- Identify \"Atmospheric Fractures\" using spirit-sight."
  - line: 241
    type: narration
    text: "- Execute First Tongue (Sek’han vel thara nix) to stabilize."
  - line: 242
    type: narration
    text: "- Pair with Adrenochrome to instantly heal Larynx Tearing."
  - line: 244
    type: narration
    text: "3."
  - line: 245
    type: narration
    text: "THE COMBAT LOOP:"
  - line: 246
    type: narration
    text: "- Activate Crimson Blood for 2x damage."
  - line: 247
    type: narration
    text: "- Maneuver to \"Geometric Intersections\" for Scythe-Bearer buffs."
  - line: 248
    type: narration
    text: "- Manage Heat levels to avoid Ironspire \"Compliance\" detection."

